  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A cloud-based case data capture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To issue a cost amendment. The Recipient will expand the tool from the regional footprint it has, to a more global set of adopters. The Recipient wil development a cloud based data capture, management and analysis platform for anti-trafficking NGOs across different countries in Asia for standardization of TIP data collection and for data research.</narrative>
